Playing my first game with PL7, I was killed by a new feature
and something which perhaps could be construed as a bug. The
new feature is a cockatrice egg which resembles any other egg
(ie your inventory just says egg) but when you eat it you turn
to stone (in stages as if you were being hit by a cockatrice).

Now my complaint is that when I eat the egg, it didn't say
anything, and then I started moving down the corridor (using
Shift-H) and as I moved along the messages:

"You are slowing down", "Your limbs are stiffening", ...,
"You have turned to stone",...,RIP

appeared. The thing is I had a lizard corpse but since I had used
Shift-H I wass moving down the corrior automatically but had
no chance to eat it.

This is very similar to the being hit while eating bug (now fixed)
and some others. Surely I should have had a chance to stop and
eat my lizard corpse?


